1360 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Kali is a hypothetical sustainable fashion brand born from the idea of transforming wedding waste into meaningful textiles\056 Rooted in eco\055printing and natural dyeing\054 the brand reimagines discarded flowers as lasting imprints on fabric\054 giving celebrations a more conscious and sustainable afterlife\056\015\n\015\nBlending nature\054 craftsmanship\054 and contemporary aesthetics\054 Kali envisions a design approach where sustainability becomes both meaningful and beautiful\056 Through thoughtful material exploration\054 the brand celebrates transformation\054 memory\054 and mindful consumption\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 1361 0 R
     /Pg 1338 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
