  << /ActualText (Kali envisions a future where celebration and sustainability coexist\056 By transforming discarded wedding flowers into meaningful textile imprints\054 the brand seeks to reimagine waste as memory creating products that are thoughtful\054 lasting\054 and environmentally conscious\056\015\n\015\nRooted in nature and guided by mindful design\054 Kali celebrates transformation through material storytelling\054 encouraging a more sustainable and emotionally meaningful relationship with fashion\056)
